# Save the Children (San d'Oria 1-3, mission.sandoria.save_the_children), a first completion. A level 75 Warrior of San
# d'Oria, rank 1 with 1-1 and 1-2 completed (GMs; Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Section 1 (no current mission,
# San d'Oria): Endracion's script opens the mission list 1009; the cancel option 1073741824: nothing (option 0 would
# begin 1-1, whose handler takes 0); again, option 102: begun, Status 1 (Southern San d'Oria's 1009). Section 2
# (current, Status below 3), Status 1: Endracion, Ambrotien and Grilau: their ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 24 texts; Arnau
# (Status below 2): 693, finished: Status 2; Arnau again (Status 2): his handler returns nothing: his default 20.
# Ghelsba Outpost: Hut_Door's battlefield menu (Save the Children, index 0), entered (area 1), the three Fodderchiefs
# killed: won, 32001; its finish: battlefieldWin 32: the Orcish Hut Key, Fodderchief Flayer, Status 3. Section 3 (Status
# 3, the key), not completed: Hut_Door's 55 (the battlefields' entry handler runs too: none on offer at Status 3:
# NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY); finished: the key taken, Status 4. Section 4 (Status 4), not completed: Endracion 1004;
# finished: rank 2, 1000 gil (npcUtil.giveCurrency), completed (the status reset, cleanup), Option 1. Section 5
# (completed, Option 1): Arnau 694; finished: Option 0; Arnau again: no section: his default 20.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Ambrotien/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1004 NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Arnau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/693 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/694 GhelsbaOutpost/Hut_Door/onTrigger GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32001 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/55
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-108.5,1,-34 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
login
trigger Endracion                       # section 1: his script's mission list 1009
finish option=1073741824                # the client's cancel (0x40000000): no mission's option: nothing
trigger Endracion                       # 1009
finish option=102                       # 102: begun, Status 1
trigger Endracion                       # section 2, Status 1: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 24
warp 93.4,0,-55.5 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Ambrotien                       # Status 1: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 24
warp -240.5,7,57.9 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Grilau                          # Status 1: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 24
warp 148,0,137 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Arnau                           # Status 1: 693
finish                                  # Status 2
trigger Arnau                           # Status 2: nothing: his default 20
finish
warp -163.5,-11.7,77.8 GhelsbaOutpost
trigger Hut_Door                        # Status 2: the battlefield menu 32000 (Save the Children, index 0)
update 32000 option=1                   # index 0, area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
tick 2000                               # the arena's first tick: the Fodderchiefs spawn
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+1
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+2               # allDeath: won; 32001
finish                                  # battlefieldWin 32: the Orcish Hut Key, Fodderchief Flayer, Status 3
tick 11000                              # the won arena's cleanup
tick 10000                              # the char out of the battlefield (its effect gone)
trigger Hut_Door                        # section 3 (Status 3, the key), not completed: 55
finish                                  # the key taken, Status 4
warp -108.5,1,-34 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Endracion                       # section 4 (Status 4), not completed: 1004
finish                                  # rank 2, 1000 gil, completed (Status 0), Option 1
warp 148,0,137 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Arnau                           # section 5 (completed, Option 1): 694
finish                                  # Option 0
trigger Arnau                           # no section: his default 20
finish
